<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank to vote on PBI merger July 17.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank to vote on PBI merger July 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish bank Kredyt Bank SA will vote on July 17 on the firm's planned merger with Polish Investment Bank SA (PBI), Kredyt said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kredyt shareholders will also vote to change their bank's name to Kredytowy Bank Polski SA.</p>
<p>Kredyt Bank plans to complete the merger with PBI by year-end to create one of Poland's 10 largest banks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
